      "t": "Уи, ты мой салат не видел?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, have you seen my salad?' Coming back to his station, Senya asks Louis if he has seen his special salad.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Это был мой лучший салат.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It was my best salad.' Not wanting to admit the leather belt was hidden in it, Senya claims it was his finest salad.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Сделай новый, время есть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Make a new one, there is time.' Unaware of what was in the bowl, Fedya tells him to just toss a fresh one while there is time.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Я не успею сделать новый.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will not have time to make a new one.' Senya panics because he knows the belt salad has already gone out to a guest.",
